# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfplan
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# NOTE: terraform.tfvars is intentionally committed - it holds only
# non-secret configuration. Never put credentials or secrets in it.
# .terraform.lock.hcl is also committed to pin provider versions.

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
